title: Fix CI change filtering at the producer

doc:
  - audience: Node Dev
    description: |
      Normalize the shared preflight change-filter output to 'true' for relevant changes
      and an empty string otherwise, preserving all existing consuming job conditions.
      Changes excluded by the current file filters now skip those jobs, while Rust changes
      and changes to the caller workflow or shared preflight continue to run them.
      File filters and event exclusions are unchanged. No crates require publishing.
crates: []
